{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of AUDIOSURF</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/extras/5c922a3c658e971d38ecc99d62743199.avif?t=1765545086\" width=616 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your music just works</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stream from the internet, play mp3 files, or even set up a microphone. Any audio playing on your machine works!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/extras/2b78d93a685db9694eefd46f369394b2.avif?t=1765545086\" width=772 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your music paints the world, and controls the action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything RED reacts to booming BASS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything PURPLE is driven by VOCALS and LEAD INSTRUMENTS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything BLUE is controlled by high-pitched TREBLE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(colors can be changed in the options)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle against music-reactive bosses and bullets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between your mech\u2019s 3 forms: Bass Knight, Vocal Gunship, and Treble Bomber to strike back. Everything synchronizes to any audio playing on your computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/extras/aa0f9da6e4287ed0ef40d2f569cda470.avif?t=1765545086\" width=616 height=245 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>AUDIOSURGE Detected!</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big exciting moments in the music automatically cause an AUDIOSURGE! Take advantage of these power plays - you become invincible and deal bonus damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/extras/0500ea66ded8e52f54db5840306a7677.avif?t=1765545086\" width=616 height=816 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2013 5 ways to play \u2013</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax Mode: You can\u2019t take damage - just enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touring Mode: Regenerate hearts over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Headliner Mode: After each wave, choose 1 heart or a powerful upgrade</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal Mode: More of all threats - no upgrades or heart recovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Rush: Straight to the boss fight.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925150?t=1765545086","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/da570ee402ef408fd5fd4b4ab180e2b28814fcbc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765545086","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/d97066864630bb08996cb9e38def1a53da580e6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765545086","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/d97066864630bb08996cb9e38def1a53da580e6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765545086","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4211230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of AUDIOSURF</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/extras/5c922a3c658e971d38ecc99d62743199.avif?t=1765545086\" width=616 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your music just works</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stream from the internet, play mp3 files, or even set up a microphone. Any audio playing on your machine works!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/extras/2b78d93a685db9694eefd46f369394b2.avif?t=1765545086\" width=772 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your music paints the world, and controls the action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything RED reacts to booming BASS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything PURPLE is driven by VOCALS and LEAD INSTRUMENTS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything BLUE is controlled by high-pitched TREBLE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(colors can be changed in the options)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle against music-reactive bosses and bullets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between your mech\u2019s 3 forms: Bass Knight, Vocal Gunship, and Treble Bomber to strike back. Everything synchronizes to any audio playing on your computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/extras/aa0f9da6e4287ed0ef40d2f569cda470.avif?t=1765545086\" width=616 height=245 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>AUDIOSURGE Detected!</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big exciting moments in the music automatically cause an AUDIOSURGE! Take advantage of these power plays - you become invincible and deal bonus damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/extras/0500ea66ded8e52f54db5840306a7677.avif?t=1765545086\" width=616 height=816 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2013 5 ways to play \u2013</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax Mode: You can\u2019t take damage - just enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touring Mode: Regenerate hearts over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Headliner Mode: After each wave, choose 1 heart or a powerful upgrade</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal Mode: More of all threats - no upgrades or heart recovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Rush: Straight to the boss fight.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dylan Fitterer"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925150/4d032df09512abdfea9f1e3b1634c01a6523b5e0/header.jpg?t=1765545086","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3925150/1406525889/e5450ef74b6c5132b6a7ce773172219e8b3b5824/1765146417/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765500392","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3925150/1406525889/e5450ef74b6c5132b6a7ce773172219e8b3b5824/1765146417/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765500392","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3925150/1406525889/e5450ef74b6c5132b6a7ce773172219e8b3b5824/1765146417/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765500392","id":257244926,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257244926/f8cd40b1a90cebcb0faa93f05a6fe9ee46bcfce7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765500392"}],"name":"AUDIOMECH: your music transformed","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><